|---|---|---|
| `objDescribe.getFieldMap()` | `objDescribe.fields` | `DescribeSObjectResult` exposes `fields` as a **property** (dot-access), not a method. |
| `entry.isValid()` | `entry.isActive` | `Schema.PicklistEntry` exposes `isActive` as a **property**, not a method. |
