## Deviation explanation

Salesforce does not allow callouts directly from a trigger. The platform error message explicitly requires a `@future(callout=true)` method. I use a single `@future(callout=true)` call that receives all new account IDs, then issues **one HTTP POST per account** inside it, preserving the "one request per new account" requirement.

